# Synopsys DC analysis DB + HAPS FPGA-prototype build outputs (not source)
/AN.DB/
# Ignore the BUILD OUTPUTS ONLY. These rules used to be /fpga/haps-sx/ and
# /fpga/haps-sx-pc/, which also swallowed ~230 KB of hand-written source --
# the board top, the .cob, the constraints and the build scripts -- despite
# the comment above saying "not source". Git cannot re-include a path under
# an excluded directory, so a negation would not have worked; the rules have
# to name the build dirs directly.
/fpga/haps-sx/build/
/fpga/haps-sx-pc/build/
